This is the ISAR Unfiltered scholarship landing page — a one-page scrollytelling
site. Full creative brief is in /docs/brief.md — read it before generating any
section.

Tech stack (do not substitute or add alternatives):
- Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- GSAP + ScrollTrigger for all scroll-driven animation
- Lenis for smooth scroll, synced to ScrollTrigger via gsap.ticker (not scrollerProxy)
- React Bits components (installed via jsrepo CLI) for text effects
- SplitType for custom text splitting GSAP animations
- Motion for React only for simple non-scroll in-view fades

Brand colors — use exactly, no tints/gradients:
- Deep green: #02462e (primary)
- Yellow: #fec700 (accent/CTA)

Tone of all copy: direct, human, confident, slightly provocative, unpolished
in a good way. Never use: visionary, ecosystem, disruptive, thought leaders,
empowering, innovative, game-changing.

Visual direction: reference zajno.com's scroll craft but bolder — larger type,
harder color blocks, grainy B&W photography, occasional off-grid rotation.
Type should overflow/crop its container on purpose in hero and CTA sections.

Build one section at a time. Each section is its own component. Add
ScrollTrigger pinning/scrubbing as the last step for each section, after
the static layout is confirmed.

Always respect prefers-reduced-motion with a static fallback.
Always lazy-init ScrollTriggers per section, never all on initial mount.

Fonts via Adobe kit https://use.typekit.net/lpk6vqu.css — do not self-host:
- Display: "zuume" (400/700/900)
- Body: "helvetica-neue-lt-pro"
- Condensed labels: "helvetica-neue-lt-pro-cond"
